00:57:24.710 --> 00:57:32.570
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our show by our boss, Mr. Torey Malatia, who's always walking up to us in the hallway, standing next to us, and saying--
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ对我们节目的管理监督来自我们的老板，托里·马拉蒂亚先生，他总是走过来走廊，站在我们旁边，说——

00:57:32.570 --> 00:57:36.990
<v Benny Perkins>You're standing next to the devil. And you're riding a road to hell.
<v Benny Perkins>你正站在恶魔身边。而且你正走在通往地狱的路上。

00:57:36.990 --> 00:57:40.760
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带回更多《美国生活》的故事。

00:57:40.760 --> 00:57:57.180
<v Benny Perkins>I said, "I'll stand here 'til you die. You may as well quit now."
<v Benny Perkins>我说，“我会站在这里直到你死掉。你还是现在就退出吧。”

00:57:57.180 --> 00:58:02.180
<v Announcer>PRI, Public Radio International. international.
<v Announcer>PRI，国际公共广播电台。国际。
